{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>For I have hardened his heart</b> — The Holy One, blessed be He, made known to Moses that He Himself hardened their hearts now, after they had feared Him because of the hail and confessed their sin. And He told him the reason: \"for I have done this,\" in order that I may set these signs among them — those signs that I desire to perform among them, so that Egypt shall know My might — not that I wish to punish them further on account of this hardening. And further, so that you and all Israel may recount to the coming generations the power of My deeds, and you shall know that I am YHWH, and all that I desire I shall do in the heavens and on the earth:"], :book :exodus, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:05:10.348519581Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}